# Glow PNG Files Directory

Place your glow PNG files here:
- build.png       - Glow for "בנה סלט כפר" card
- recommended.png - Glow for "המומלצים שלו" card
- login.png       - Glow for "התחברות משתמש" card

PNG requirements:
- Transparent PNG format
- Match video's lighting and perspective
- Size: slightly larger than card hotspot area (~20% padding for glow bleed)
- Recommended resolution: match video resolution (1080x1920)

Note: If PNG files are missing, the app will automatically use CSS gradient fallbacks,
so the app will work even without these files.
